# The ladder baseline is deliberately committed: scripts/backtest_ladder.py
# exists to diff a ladder change against a number, and a baseline that is
# not in git makes that a diff against nothing. Measured 2026-08-29:
# 8 sources, 5 ok, success_rate 0.625, p50 8.1ms, by_via direct 4 /
# flaresolverr 1. It contains no credentials — only source URLs, results
# and latencies.
!data/
!data/ladder_baseline.json

